name: sim.setJointMaxForce
description: 
luaSynopsis: sim.setJointMaxForce(int objectHandle,float forceOrTorque)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setJointMaxForce(int objectHandle,float forceOrTorque)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. objectHandle: handle of the joint object
2. forceOrTorque: the maximum force or torque that the joint can exert. This cannot be a negative value.
